### Reindex API Test File
### Base URL: http://localhost:7004

### Get available views
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reindex/views
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reindex Personnel view
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reindex/view/Personnel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reindex Vehicle view
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reindex/view/Vehicle
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reindex Location view
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reindex/view/Location
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reindex Food view
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reindex/view/Food
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reindex Meal view
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reindex/view/Meal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reindex Contractor view
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reindex/view/Contractor
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reindex OrganizationalChart view
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reindex/view/OrganizationalChart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reindex OrganizationalPosition view
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reindex/view/OrganizationalPosition
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reindex all views
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reindex/all
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get reindex status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reindex/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:7004
@token = your-jwt-token-here
